# Documentation on the collaboration, a pool, a lane and elements, in line,
# attribute and block form.
# covers: §4.6
title "Refunds"
doc Handles refunds for orders returned within 30 days.

pool Shop
  doc The online shop, including its returns desk.
  lanes Returns desk [doc: "Staff at the warehouse returns counter."]
  lane Returns desk
  start Parcel returned
  service Validate order
  doc Checks each line against the catalogue -> unknown items are rejected (see #refund-rules).
  doc A second doc line is joined to the first with a line break.
  user Inspect goods [doc: "Look for damage and missing parts."]
  service Refund payment
  doc
    Refunds the original payment method.

    Exception: gift cards are refunded as store credit.
  end Refunded
